("event/dismiss" :names (":DISMISS") :kind :event :kind-name "Event" :package "LUT" :summary "ANCHORED-SURFACE: reason keyword (:DISMISS/:ACCEPT/:ESCAPE/:OUTSIDE/:REANCHOR/:MODAL/:OWNER-UNAVAILABLE/:OWNER-DETACHED/:DISPOSE) after owner/scope/capture references are released. Explicit dismissal emits once per shown session; disposal clears quietly under disposed-widget event suppression. Errors do not roll back dismissal." :position 404467)
