("event/model-disposing" :names (":MODEL-DISPOSING") :kind :event :kind-name "Event" :package "LUT" :summary "DATA-MODEL: NIL while beginning disposal. Views detach; source disposal disposes dependent projections/selections. All active disposal handlers are attempted before cleanup; the first observer error is then propagated. Recursive disposal is idempotent." :position 416238)
